[
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_1_0",
    "text": "我想请假",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_1_1",
    "text": "我想加班",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_1_2",
    "text": "我想喝水",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_1_3",
    "text": "我想上厕所",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_1_4",
    "text": "我想换班",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_1_5",
    "text": "我想当组长",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_1_6",
    "text": "我想多学点",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_1_7",
    "text": "我想重做",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_2_0",
    "text": "有没有物料？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_2_1",
    "text": "有没有螺丝？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_2_2",
    "text": "有没有手套？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_2_3",
    "text": "有没有胶水？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_2_4",
    "text": "有没有扳手？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_2_5",
    "text": "有没有纸箱？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_2_6",
    "text": "有没有奖金？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_2_7",
    "text": "有没有样品？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_3_0",
    "text": "这个多少个？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_3_1",
    "text": "这个多少箱？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_3_2",
    "text": "这个多少公斤？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_3_3",
    "text": "这个多少米？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_3_4",
    "text": "这个多少双？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_3_5",
    "text": "这个多少包？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_3_6",
    "text": "这个多少钱？",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_4_0",
    "text": "因为机器坏了，所以需要维修",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_4_1",
    "text": "因为没有物料，所以我去仓库领",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_4_2",
    "text": "因为身体不舒服，所以我想请假",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_4_3",
    "text": "因为零件卡住了，所以还要半小时",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_4_4",
    "text": "因为大家很努力，所以今天超产了",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_5_0",
    "text": "请帮我看看这个",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_5_1",
    "text": "请帮我叫维修工",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_5_2",
    "text": "请帮我搬过去",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_5_3",
    "text": "请帮我拿一下扳手",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_5_4",
    "text": "请帮我签字",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "slot_frame_5_5",
    "text": "请帮我检查一下",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_boss_1",
    "text": "快点搞！下班前完不成扣钱！",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_1_0",
    "text": "好好，马上搞定！放心！",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_1_1",
    "text": "我不知道，去问别人吧。",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_1_2",
    "text": "我不干了，太累了。",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_boss_2",
    "text": "搞什么鬼？！这批货怎么全是不良品？！",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_2_0",
    "text": "对不起主管，物料卡住了，我马上改！",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_2_1",
    "text": "不是我的错，是上个班次的！",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_2_2",
    "text": "坏了就扔掉呗。",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_boss_3",
    "text": "行不行啊？不行我就换别人做了！",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_3_0",
    "text": "行！绝对没问题，交给我！",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_3_1",
    "text": "随便你换谁。",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_3_2",
    "text": "我太难了，做不了。",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_boss_4",
    "text": "听懂了没有？！重复一遍！",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_4_0",
    "text": "听懂了！先停机断电，再找维修！",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_4_1",
    "text": "声音太小没听清。",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_4_2",
    "text": "我不懂中文。",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_boss_5",
    "text": "二号线缺人，你现在过去支援！",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_5_0",
    "text": "好的老大！我交接完马上过去！",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_5_1",
    "text": "我不去，我这边没做完。",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
  {
    "id": "crisis_ans_5_2",
    "text": "加钱我就去。",
    "type": "sentences",
    "exists": false
  },
